---------- ----                                                                                    
        21 * Improve formatting of statements containing JSON operators (issue542).                
        80 * Fix formatting error in EXTRACT function (issue562, issue670, pr676, by ecederstrand).
        83 * Allow any unicode character as valid identifier name (issue641).                      
       128 * Remaining strings that only consist of whitespaces are not treated as                 
       146 * Improve formatting of type casts in parentheses.                                      
       147 * Stabilize formatting of invalid SQL statements.                                       
       157 * Enhance formatting of AS keyword (issue507, by john-bodley).                          
       187 * New formatting option "--indent_after_first" (pr345, by johshoff).                    
       188 * New formatting option "--indent_columns" (pr393, by digitalarbeiter).                 
       190 * Strip multiple whitespace within parentheses (issue473, by john-bodley).              
       198 * Fix reindent issue for parenthesis (issue427, by fredyw).                             
       205 * Fix formatting on INSERT which caused staircase effect on values (issue329,           
       207 * Avoid formatting of psql commands (issue469).                                         
       244 * Fix indentation of LIMIT (by romainr, issue320).                                      
       270 * `is_whitespace` and `is_group` changed into properties                                
       314 * Better support for CTEs (issue217, by Andrew Tipton).                                 
       317 * Add wrap_after option for better alignment when formatting                            
       319 * Add reindent-aligned option for alternate formatting (Adam Greenhall)                 
       324 * Leading whitespaces are now removed when format() is called with                      
       325   strip_whitespace=True (issue213, by shenlongxing).                                    
       331 * Improve formatting of CASE WHEN constructs (issue164, by vmuriat).                    
       374 * sqlformat command line tool doesn't duplicate newlines anymore (issue191).            
       396 * Improve formatting of HAVING statements.                                              
       403 * Support comments starting with '#' character (issue178).                              
       414 * Fix indentation when using tabs (issue146).                                           
       418 * Improved formatting in list when newlines precede commas (issue140).                  
       453 * Fix parsing and formatting of statements containing EXCEPT keyword.                   
       493 * New option to truncate long string literals when formatting.                          
       503 * Whitespaces within certain keywords are now allowed (issue97, patch proposed          
       512 * sqlparse.split() now removes leading and trailing whitespaces from split              
       523 * Fix Python 3 compatibility of sqlformat script (by Pi Delport).                       
       536 * Improve formatting of ORDER BY clauses (issue89).                                     
       537 * Formatter now tries to detect runaway indentations caused by                          
       538   parsing errors or invalid SQL statements. When re-indenting such                      
       539   statements the formatter flips back to column 0 before going crazy.                   
       572 * Improve grouping and formatting of identifiers with operators (issue53).              
       573 * Improve grouping and formatting of concatenated strings (issue53).                    
       585 * Add sqlformat.parsestream (by quest).                                                 
       602 * Pretty format comments in identifier lists (issue59).                                 
       612 * When formatting a statement a space before LIMIT was removed (issue35).               
       621 * Don't treat single characters as keywords (issue32).                                  
       640 * Stricter detection of identifier aliases (issue8, reported by estama).                
       642 * Fixed an issue with trailing whitespaces (reported by Kris).                          
       646 * Lots of minor fixes targeting encoding, indentation, statement
