Implemented the fix in `sqlparse/filters/others.py:94`, where trailing whitespace inside a nested group is now removed by the whitespace filter, eliminating the extra space before closing parentheses in CTE/nested expressions.

Added regression tests in `tests/test_format.py` (nested expression and CTE cases) and a CHANGELOG entry. Full suite: 443 passed, 3 xfailed.
